<title>UK: New Zealand sets 100 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>New Zealand sets 100 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8055  PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.618    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NZ	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	DIRECT, UNSECURED AND UNCONDITIONAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
